    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d584">

                <pb facs="0497" n="381" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg381"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 838.516/32.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                            Vice President Wehrhane of the National Bank of
                            Haiti.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1914-12-31">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 31, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department has received cable from Port au Prince with request to forward to you,
                    which it does, paraphrased, as follows: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The Haitian Government took from our vaults $65,000. It claims this
                            action to be in the execution of the judgment following the law of
                            August 14th.</p>
                        <p rendition="#right">
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Williams</hi>.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">W. J. Bryan</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
